{
  "title": "Quick Springy Croatian Corn Grill",
  "description": "A flavorful and nutritious dish from Croatia, perfect for a quick meal. This recipe combines the crunch of spring corn with the nutty taste of poppy seeds.",
  "cuisine": "Croatian",
  "diet": [
